; No script-shell override here on purpose (removed 2026-09-07). apps/web's build/lint
; scripts are now plain Node (tools/build.mjs, tools/lint.mjs) with zero shell-dialect
; dependence, so npm's platform default shell works everywhere - Windows cmd.exe and
; Linux CI runners alike. A prior version pinned script-shell to git-bash to fix a
; Windows-only bug in the old inline scripts; that same pin broke this repo's GitLab CI
; runner (Linux has no such path). Don't reintroduce a shell-shaped fix for a shell-shaped
; bug - fix the script instead, as done here.
